  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Protecting Children - Child rights and youth empowerment</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The project will provide protection and education to children at risk in slums in Bangalore and Hyderabad.  It will advocate with concerned departments and agencies for better treatment of children in their care, and provide training to duty bearers on child rights/protection/participation. It will educate families on the importance of birth registration and education for girls, and will work with government schools to make sure they implement the Karnataka Child Protection Policy.</narrative>
  </description>
